        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border-t-4 border-[#3b55d5] card-hover reveal">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🏫</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1f2025] text-lg mb-2">Schulfeste & Kita-Events</h3>
          <p class="text-[#374151] text-sm leading-relaxed">Sommerfest, Abschlussfeier oder Weihnachtsfeier im Kindergarten</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border-t-4 border-[#ffb546] card-hover reveal">
